**집행 정본 (수동-only 금지 — 순서 생략 = K-2.5)**:

```bash
python automation/harness_sync.py rule-reloc --action record --from-path OLD --to-path NEW --note "앵커"
python automation/harness_sync.py rule-reloc --action move --from-path OLD --to-path NEW
# WORKTREE_BY_FILENAME · RULE_CHARACTER_ROWS · cross-ref · RULE_TREE.md 동기
python automation/harness_sync.py rule-reloc --action mark-done --num N
python automation/harness_sync.py rule-reloc --action finalize   # smoke PASS → ledger idle + archive
```

| # | MUST |
|---|------|
| 1 | **`rule-reloc record`** 또는 ledger `pending` 행 (임시 저장소) |
| 2 | **`rule-reloc move`** = `git mv` — 포인터-only **금지** |
| 3 | **`rule_paths.WORKTREE_BY_FILENAME`** · **`RULE_CHARACTER_ROWS`** · cross-ref · **RULE_TREE.md** |
| 4 | **`mark-done`** — 이동 1건당 |
| 5 | **`rule-reloc finalize`** — `rule_worktree_layout` + `rule_deletion_guard` smoke **PASS 필수** |
| 6 | finalize PASS → **`0_Config/_archive/rule_reloc_history.jsonl`** 이관 · ledger **표·기록 삭제(idle)** |

- **신규·교체 `.mdc`**: **K-0-C-A** — 룰트리 슬롯 + `WORKTREE_BY_FILENAME` 등록 **후** flat `.cursor/rules/` 루트 **금지**.
- **롤백**: 역방향 `git mv` + ledger `reverted` — finalize **전**만. flat 복원 **금지**.

